{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Dainsleif": 74,
    "Paimon": 57,
    "Player": 43
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "800101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dainsleif",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80010101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80010101": {
            "id": "80010101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "So we meet again... a little sooner than I had expected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010102"
            ]
          },
          "80010102": {
            "id": "80010102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, it's Dain!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010103"
            ]
          },
          "80010103": {
            "id": "80010103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Judging by your expression, it seems you just experienced something quite strange.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010104"
            ]
          },
          "80010104": {
            "id": "80010104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Could it be that you encountered an Abyss Herald in those ruins?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010105"
            ]
          },
          "80010105": {
            "id": "80010105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh!? How did you know that?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010106"
            ]
          },
          "80010106": {
            "id": "80010106",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "I've been on the Abyss Herald's trail. I didn't expect to find you here as well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010109"
            ]
          },
          "80010109": {
            "id": "80010109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "An inverted Statue of The Seven... holding Abyssal power in its hands? No, I have never seen such a thing during my time fighting the Abyss... though I have had my suspicions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010110"
            ]
          },
          "80010110": {
            "id": "80010110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Tell me the rest of what happened in there. So you escaped the ruin depths filled with Abyssal power, and then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010111"
            ]
          },
          "80010111": {
            "id": "80010111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And then, as we got close to the exit, an Abyss Herald suddenly appeared and blocked our way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010112"
            ]
          },
          "80010112": {
            "id": "80010112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We fought a big battle with that thing. Maybe it hasn't gotten too far yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010113"
            ]
          },
          "80010113": {
            "id": "80010113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Yes, this is a rare opportunity indeed. Come, let's catch up to it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800102",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of the Abyss Order",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80010201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80010201": {
            "id": "80010201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Those Abyss Mages just now... were they trying to ambush us?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010202"
            ]
          },
          "80010202": {
            "id": "80010202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "No, they were just digging through these abandoned Ruin Guards looking for something of value.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010203"
            ]
          },
          "80010203": {
            "id": "80010203",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, is that so... The Traveler here seems to like doing that a lot, too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010204"
            ]
          },
          "80010204": {
            "id": "80010204",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looking for Chaos Devices, Chaos Circuits... You know, that kinda stuff.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010207"
            ]
          },
          "80010207": {
            "id": "80010207",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "They wouldn't be searching for such ordinary objects.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010208"
            ]
          },
          "80010208": {
            "id": "80010208",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "In fact, I was nearby investigating precisely because Abyss Mages often come out from that ruin to explore.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010209"
            ]
          },
          "80010209": {
            "id": "80010209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "They seem to be searching the remains of Ruin Guards for a certain valuable object to take back to the ruins.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010210"
            ]
          },
          "80010210": {
            "id": "80010210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "However, they look disappointed, so it would seem they haven't found it yet...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010211"
            ]
          },
          "80010211": {
            "id": "80010211",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well then, why didn't you grab one of them just now and ask what they were up to?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800103",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dainsleif",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800104",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of the Abyss Order",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80010401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80010401": {
            "id": "80010401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? This Abyss Mage dropped a talisman... Could it be a communication of some kind?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010402"
            ]
          },
          "80010402": {
            "id": "80010402",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Hmm, this talisman seems connected to the Abyss Herald. But why would an Abyss Mage be carrying it...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010403"
            ]
          },
          "80010403": {
            "id": "80010403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Perhaps it really does contain information about their operation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010404"
            ]
          },
          "80010404": {
            "id": "80010404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But, Paimon can't read the writing on it... *gasp* Is that the script of Khaenri'ah?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010405"
            ]
          },
          "80010405": {
            "id": "80010405",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "#\"...Engulf the faith of the enemy in flame, and bring glory to {F#His Highness, the Prince}{M#Her Highness, the Princess}...\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010406"
            ]
          },
          "80010406": {
            "id": "80010406",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wha—!? Is that what it says?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010407"
            ]
          },
          "80010407": {
            "id": "80010407",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "\"...'Loom of Fate,' initial operation.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010408"
            ]
          },
          "80010408": {
            "id": "80010408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "They... the Abyss, seem to be carrying out a large operation. The keyword here is \"Loom of Fate.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010409"
            ]
          },
          "80010409": {
            "id": "80010409",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "It seems like they are still launching the operation, or rather, are still conducting preliminary tests...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010410"
            ]
          },
          "80010410": {
            "id": "80010410",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Loom of Fate\"? What's that? Is it literally a... fate-weaving machine?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010413"
            ]
          },
          "80010413": {
            "id": "80010413",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "From the horrible feeling Paimon's been getting, those eerie ruins are super likely to be related to this fate-weaving operation.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010414"
            ]
          },
          "80010414": {
            "id": "80010414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So Dain, what message does this talisman contain?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010415"
            ]
          },
          "80010415": {
            "id": "80010415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "I'm reading it now...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010416"
            ]
          },
          "80010416": {
            "id": "80010416",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Hmm... An ambitious operation, but some parts are difficult to understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010417"
            ]
          },
          "80010417": {
            "id": "80010417",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "How so?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010418"
            ]
          },
          "80010418": {
            "id": "80010418",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "In short, the first phase of the plan is related to Osial, Overlord of the Vortex.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010419"
            ]
          },
          "80010419": {
            "id": "80010419",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Overlord of the Vortex!? You mean that god in the ocean?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800105",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Dainsleif",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "80010301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "80010301": {
            "id": "80010301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Wow... Besides the Abyss Order, Ruin Guards sure are active around here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010302"
            ]
          },
          "80010302": {
            "id": "80010302",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seems wherever we find an Abyss Mage hideout, there's often a bunch of Ruin Guards roaming around too. Is that just a coincidence, or...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010303"
            ]
          },
          "80010303": {
            "id": "80010303",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "There are no coincidences in the world. Everything is the fruit of seeds planted long ago.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010304"
            ]
          },
          "80010304": {
            "id": "80010304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Just like your appearance in that tavern... Time is just waiting for those seeds to sprout.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010307"
            ]
          },
          "80010307": {
            "id": "80010307",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Forget it. Just some needless musings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010308"
            ]
          },
          "80010308": {
            "id": "80010308",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "The connection between the Abyss Order and the Ruin Guards is by no means incidental.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010309"
            ]
          },
          "80010309": {
            "id": "80010309",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Rather, they are both branches that have grown out and up from the same roots below.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010310"
            ]
          },
          "80010310": {
            "id": "80010310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Branches\"? \"Roots\"? What do you mean exactly?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010311"
            ]
          },
          "80010311": {
            "id": "80010311",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Both originate from an ancient nation that was destroyed 500 years ago — Khaenri'ah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010312"
            ]
          },
          "80010312": {
            "id": "80010312",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Khaenri'ah!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010313"
            ]
          },
          "80010313": {
            "id": "80010313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Really!? The Abyss Order and Ruin Guards are left over from after the destruction of that nation!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010314"
            ]
          },
          "80010314": {
            "id": "80010314",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh... Speaking of Khaenri'ah, that's really a super ancient name...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010315"
            ]
          },
          "80010315": {
            "id": "80010315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, right. As your guide, Paimon should explain a bit here. A long time ago, the nation of Khaenri'ah was...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010316"
            ]
          },
          "80010316": {
            "id": "80010316",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I know about Khaenri'ah...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010317"
            ]
          },
          "80010317": {
            "id": "80010317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010318"
            ]
          },
          "80010318": {
            "id": "80010318",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Because I have memories of Khaenri'ah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010319"
            ]
          },
          "80010319": {
            "id": "80010319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You have memories of being there? But that nation was destroyed 500 years ago...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010320"
            ]
          },
          "80010320": {
            "id": "80010320",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010321"
            ]
          },
          "80010321": {
            "id": "80010321",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "Is that so? Well, everyone has their secrets. You did not pry into mine, so I shall not pry into yours...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "80010322"
            ]
          },
          "80010322": {
            "id": "80010322",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Dainsleif",
            "text": "But if you would like to tell me, I will listen... So, the Khaenri'ah you saw, what was it like?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "800109",
      "subQuestName": "Look for traces of the Abyss Order",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
